<title>USA: International Tech sets Korean venture.</title>
<headline>International Tech sets Korean venture.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Technology Corp said it formed of a 50/50 joint venture with KOHAP Inc .</p>
<p>The joint venture company, KOHAP-IT Ltd, will pursue a broad range of environmental infrastructure opportunities in South Korea, International Technology said.</p>
<p>The company said KOHAP-IT expects its first major project to involve the design, supply, construction, and start-up of an incineration facility for KOHAP's petrochemical refinery and manufacturing operations in Ulsan, a South Korean industrial city.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
